/dist
# The two browser modules, built by `just build-web`.
/web/dist
# The renderer and the stylesheet the pages read through, written by the site publish. Never committed: a 2.7 MB module and a generated stylesheet are a worse tree to work in than the drift they end.
/assets/leaftext
# The page every address on the site serves and the listing it reads, written by the site's own deploy beside the documents. Never committed: a page written here would be whatever the README said the day somebody wrote it.
/index.html
/documents.json
.release-tag
/.tmp
.agents/settings.local.json
# The pictures the publish writes beside their PNG masters. Never committed: the repo keeps one format so nothing that takes, joins or checks a picture learns a second.
/imgs/**/*.webp
